  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total&nbsp;cases&nbsp;will be &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p>Now favourable cases for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>d</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p>Case&nbsp;(I) if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>d</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math> can&nbsp;take the value&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively</p><p>Case&nbsp;(II) if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>d</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;can take value&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively</p><p>Case&nbsp;(III) if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>d</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;can&nbsp;take value <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively</p><p>So&nbsp;total favourable case will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>So probability<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>favourable</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cases</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>outcomes</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
